{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S08、S11、S12等较短时段安排的感受提示偏多，即使分时出现，观众也容易顾着读字而错过音乐；X的固定双栏布局在这些段落更方便整体浏览和回看。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮的关键词迅速建立每段的注意力中心，话语与感受交替出现，又让不少感受提示跟随音乐实际发生，观众更容易抓住正在发生什么。它对人物心理的因果关系和前后转折交代得更清楚，尤其把舍不得亲近、害怕孤单、不愿重新忍受委屈以及最终选择继续生活串成了一条完整的心理发展线。感受描写也比X更具体地结合了音色、节奏、身体反应和情绪变化，细腻度更高；不过部分短段的信息密度确实影响即时阅读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1a24c4c8-b35a-46b4-a8b3-8534a0182078", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005308543648Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:54:29.525440+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3dd09ae88254deb8b6fd57198afea144d67d188b2f8e89d6a51ca100a376387a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308c